issues.fix_suggestion:
Rewrite commands.json to match the standard schema. Example:
{
  "name": "hwinfo",
  "description": "Probe for hardware information",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/openSUSE/hwinfo",
  "type": "tool",
  "versions": {
    "25.2": {
      "ref": "hwinfo/25.2",
      "binary": false
    }
  }
}
If per-command documentation is desired, it can be placed in a separate file or in the manifest.yaml.
